@startuml
title AromaType Deployment View

skinparam shadowing false

node "Developer machine / VPS host" as Host {
  node "Docker Compose project" as Compose {
    container "caddy:2-alpine\nreverse proxy + static frontend" as Caddy
    container "aromatype-backend\nGo API" as Backend
    container "aromatype-catalogbot\nGo Telegram bot\nprofile: catalogbot" as Bot
    database "postgres:16-alpine" as Postgres
    folder "uploads_data volume" as Uploads
    folder "postgres_data volume" as PgData
  }
}

cloud "Telegram" as Telegram
cloud "Browser / Telegram WebView" as WebView
cloud "GitHub Actions" as GHA

WebView --> Caddy : HTTPS / static frontend
Caddy --> Backend : /api, /health, /docs, /openapi.yaml, /uploads
Backend --> Postgres : DATABASE_URL
Backend --> Uploads : uploaded files
Postgres --> PgData : persistent data

Telegram --> Bot : Bot API updates
Bot --> Postgres : catalog reads/writes
Bot --> Uploads : product photos

GHA --> Backend : docker build
GHA --> Backend : go test, go vet, govulncheck
GHA --> Caddy : deployment artifact source

note right of Host
The previous public VPS deployment was removed on 2026-07-03.
This view documents the supported Docker topology for future deployment.
end note

@enduml
